        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 956AR, Arched Plate with Square Glass Knobs</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <a href=\"/collections/omnia-prodigy-collection\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Collections</b></a> decorative arched rose back plate has all the romantic styling that you would expect from its classic design and is combined with  clear glass square knobs. The Omnia 956AR is sure to show your styling design and is available in 7 finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Omnia 956AR Arched Plate with Square Glass Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>55° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers Standard 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 956AR Arched Plate with Square Glass Knobs:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob: 2\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arch Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arch Rose Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
